  m_Name: Units Info_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3841523fe3ad24d4d9267aca451f60b9, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 9413222400
    m_Localized: Toad
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 361445351424
    m_Localized: 'There are three things you can watch forever.

      But you don''t
      need to.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 323189104640
    m_Localized: Bonfire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 68569686016
    m_Localized: A laconic warrior with a mysterious past.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21010977021952
    m_Localized: Bite-bug
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21099648802816
    m_Localized: Bite-bugs, despite their aggressiveness, are quite easily tamed,
      which is used by some shady individuals.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21616189923328
    m_Localized: Hermit cancer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21661895254016
    m_Localized: Look at your feet, there is nothing worse than a hermit cancer stuck
      in a boot. It likes to hang around with other creatures, because he thinks
      it's safe in their shadow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22361630990336
    m_Localized: Mossy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23525957197824
    m_Localized: A barely noticeable piece of moss that walks aimlessly in a random
      direction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23778005508096
    m_Localized: Lizard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24034424283136
    m_Localized: Fearless thugs who always have a second chance. Lizard tails give
      their bearers the opportunity to escape death in the most desperate situations.
      That's why they are highly valued on the black market.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24577465016320
    m_Localized: Rat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24776056922112
    m_Localized: They like to attack in a crowd and use dirty tricks. The weak ones
      alone grow bolder as other rats appear on the battlefield. They could become
      the scourge of the whole neighborhood, but their meanness is compensated by
      the fact that they have one common brain cell for their entire rat community.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25263867060224
    m_Localized: Rats have never learned how to take inventory, which is why they
      sometimes have such strange fellas. This was not supposed to be a strong unit
      under any circumstances, but he inspires his fellow men with an unthinkable
      level of confidence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27189249728512
    m_Localized: Piece of slime
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27310398005248
    m_Localized: Piece of long-range slime
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27817434832896
    m_Localized: Slime
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27843418546176
    m_Localized: Long-range slime
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31161712795648
    m_Localized: Large slime
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31292889653248
    m_Localized: Large long-range slime
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31641230794752
    m_Localized: Huge slime
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31953559642112
    m_Localized: Many people naively believe that a slime cut in half is a pure and
      beautiful victory. Bad for them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32687722225664
    m_Localized: A brainless but persistent creature crawls towards its goal to get
      rid of it. He will try to split if he finds out on his turn that his health
      has dropped to less than half.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33000831213568
    m_Localized: Turtle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33296814858240
    m_Localized: An aggressive warrior. Turtles, accustomed to a solitary life, prefer
      to rely on protection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33243178098688
    m_Localized: Spiked turtle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33968624918528
    m_Localized: Walking mushroom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34212657913856
    m_Localized: Supports enemy units on the battlefield. Over time, the fungi realized
      that living beings would not resist the spread of spores if the spores helped,
      not harmed. However, mushrooms have different goals now. It will not spread
      its spores to small enemies and other mushrooms.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36019954147328
    m_Localized: Unlike its brethren, who strengthen enemies, this one intends to
      deal with the toad as quickly as possible. Still unable to deal damage, she
      makes her target vulnerable to other opponents.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 54757176795136
    m_Localized: 'The toad''s main weapon is its powers of observation. Always inspect
      new enemies, it gives a lot of useful information.


      You have met the
      first enemy and now movement will not be free: each of your actions consumes
      action points (AP) (blue circles at the bottom of the screen). To restore AP,
      you need to end the turn and wait for the end of the turn of enemies.


      It
      doesn''t look like this turtle is planning to attack, but it won''t let you
      pass that easily either.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57121162027008
    m_Localized: Box
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57186815467520
    m_Localized: An unremarkable box, except that it blocks the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57475958202368
    m_Localized: Iron box
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57558082674688
    m_Localized: An indestructible obstacle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 444241064124416
    m_Localized: exit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3197246943420416
    m_Localized: Exit to the main menu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
